    feat: migrate tracking to SwanLab and add joint13 LIBERO workflows
    
    Use native SwanLab tracking in both trainers and the LIBERO submodule, with checkpoint resume compatibility and offline logging tests.
    
    Update schema 8 joint13 data conversion, normalization, and validation datasets. Add LIBERO regeneration, annotation, and experiment tools with reproducibility reports; exclude local wheels and TFRecord samples.

